    "text": "By Christopher Keizur ,\n8 hours ago A group of fitness buffs are standing strong in the fight against a disease. Rebel Fit Club, the largest Parkinson’s disease training center, headquartered in Tigard, is launching a new boxing-based training program in Gresham to commemorate Parkinson’s Disease Awareness Month (April). The new program will be based... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
